Third-party notes

This project is an independent community plugin. It is not affiliated with,
authorized by, or endorsed by OpenCode (anomalyco), DeepSeek, or Dataelem.

It interoperates with a third-party HTTP service. Reproducing a client identity
to reach a promotional free tier may conflict with that service's terms of use.
Review those terms yourself before relying on this software, and be aware that
the upstream service may change or withdraw the offer at any time.

The verbatim `read` and `shell` tool definitions in lib/fingerprint.js are
reproduced from the OpenCode CLI for interoperability; they remain the property
of their respective authors and are used here only as wire-format constants.
